# Byte-for-byte output check over the committed fixtures. Unlike the FileCheck
# suites, which assert selected lines, this compares complete stdout, stderr and
# exit codes against tests/golden/*.txt -- so an unreviewed rendering change
# fails here even when every CHECK still matches.
#
# Re-record after an intentional change and review the diff:
#   python tests/check-golden.py . --update
#
# Set DPM_TRACE_BIN to run the same cases against another implementation.
# RUN: %python %root/tests/check-golden.py %root | FileCheck %s

# CHECK: golden output checks passed
